   "notes": "Combined BM3 plus Holland-Powell thermal-pressure fit. The 300 K reference data are from Monteseguro et al. (2019), while the thermal contribution is constrained by the present resistive- and laser-heating experiments. Equation 2 uses a fixed 298 K Einstein temperature and the arithmetic mean of upstream/downstream pyrometry. The 122-row supplement contains the laser-heating observations but not the Monteseguro 300 K series or the 833 K resistive-heating series visible in Supplementary Figure 5; neither paper publishes the regression weights or covariance. A source-conditioned fit therefore holds the published BM3 coefficients fixed and tests alpha0 only; a four-parameter fit to the laser-heating rows alone is reported as a non-identifiability diagnostic, not as a reproduction of the combined fit. fcc Ir remained stable to 101 GPa and 5600 K in the investigated range.",
